# doc: misc/marketing/screenshot-docs/GFM and Obsidian.md
# window: 860,640
# modes: light
# length: 15500
# appstore: yes
# cuts: 1
# expect: tour, Edmund, Valiant
# alt: A tour of Edmund: a checklist item with a highlight and a wikilink, inline math, a table cell, then Read mode.
# The App Store preview: one take, top to bottom, each beat rendering as it is
# typed: list continuation with ==highlight== and [[wikilink]], inline math,
# bold in a table cell, then ⌘E to Read mode (the one cut) and a held end.
zoom in
caretafter Turkish delight, eventually
# --- record ---
sleep 1000
enter
type Write a ==tour== of [[Edmund]]
sleep 700
enter
enter
enter
type Euler, in one line: $e^{i\pi} + 1 = 0$
sleep 1000
caretafter Lucy
sleep 300
type  the **Valiant**
sleep 400
save
sleep 300
viewmode
